  "intro": "ECMA-262 defines static tail-position analysis (IsInTailPosition / HasCallInTailPosition) and a runtime hook (PrepareForTailCall) used for Proper Tail Calls (PTC). JROC can emit .NET tail calls for eligible statically resolved functions, including final comma operands and nullish-coalescing right operands with the object-returning ABI. General PTC for runtime-dispatched and tagged-template calls is not supported.",
